## Explicit permission for care facilities

Printing this material, handing it to residents, staff, or visitors, or
using it to give a talk is always permitted — including for nursing
homes, assisted living communities, senior centers, hospitals, libraries,
and similar facilities, even though these are commercial businesses. This
project treats that as non-commercial use: the material itself is never
being sold, licensed for a fee, or used to advertise anything.

What isn't permitted: selling this material itself, charging for access
to it, or using it to promote or endorse a commercial product or service.

